b N_{\\geq1}^{\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}}\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1bf4bc889b65fb80\" href=\"?note=1bf4bc889b65fb80\" title=\"29-df-resource-constructibility\">29-df-resource-constructibility</a> 定义</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DSPACE}\">\\(\\mathrm{DSPACE}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}space\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\forall s,t\\in\\mathrm{SpaceConstructible}\\;\\Biggl(\\Bigl(\\forall n\\geq2\\;t(n)\\geq\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil\\land\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{t(n)}{s(n)}=0\\Bigr)\\Longrightarrow\\Bigl(\\mathrm{DSPACE}[t(n)]\\subsetneq\\mathrm{DSPACE}[s(n)]\\land\\exists L\\in\\mathrm{DSPACE}[s(n)]\\setminus\\mathrm{DSPACE}[t(n)]\\Bigr)\\Biggr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}space\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\forall s,t\\in\\mathrm{SpaceConstructible}\\;\\Biggl(\\Bigl(\\forall n\\geq2\\;t(n)\\geq\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil\\land\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{t(n)}{s(n)}=0\\Bigr)\\Longrightarrow\\Bigl(\\mathrm{DSPACE}[t(n)]\\subsetneq\\mathrm{DSPACE}[s(n)]\\land\\exists L\\in\\mathrm{DSPACE}[s(n)]\\setminus\\mathrm{DSPACE}[t(n)]\\Bigr)\\Biggr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-resource-constructibility","status":"resolved","id":"1bf4bc889b65fb80","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excer